              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Naomi Segers"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Wonderful all by itself, but even better with a smashed up Butterfinger in it :-)\nI used 1 cup of heavy whipping cream and 3 cups of half and half instead of the cream and milk. Came out wonderfully delicious!",
